id=cpu-oc-guard
name=CPU overclock guard
version=1
versionCode=1
author=manvindar
description=Caps the fast cluster (cpu0-3) at the stock 2.301 GHz as early as Magisk can, so a kernel whose OPP table has a 2.5 GHz step does not run it before the voltage trim is set. Raise the cap on purpose with scaling_max_freq.
